/p>\n", "last_modified": 1792809175, "replies": 35, "id": 1251425}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c9f0/f895/8_large.png?m=1630643991", "name": "iphone", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c9f0/f895/8_normal.png?m=1630643991", "title": "iPhone", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/iphone", "topics": 13199, "footer": "这里绝不讨论如何获得 iPhone 盗版软件、iTunes 黑卡之类。", "header": "Say hello to the future.", "title_alternative": "iPhone", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c9f0/f895/8_mini.png?m=1630643991", "stars": 3640, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 8, "parent_node_name": "apple"}, "member": {"id": 101957, "username": "leshijiazu", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/leshijiazu", "website": "", "twitter": "", "psn": "", "github": "", "btc": "", "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/046fbc9c833623dd00c016675b32419e?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/046fbc9c833623dd00c016675b32419e?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/046fbc9c833623dd00c016675b32419e?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1425339021, "last_modified": 1738393764, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "leshijiazu", "last_touched": 1792860813, "title": "国行 iPhone Duo 如何在境内写入境外 eSIM？", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251454", "created": 1792815680, "deleted": 0, "content": "如题\n- iPhone Duo 国行\n- iOS 27.0.1\n- 中国联通 eSIM 已安装\n\n1 ，我用 Anygo 把 iPhone Duo 的定位改到了纽约\n2 ，用另一台 iPhone 上的 Tello 美国流量共享热点\n\n当在 iPhone Duo 国行上点击添加 eSIM ，会显示“ 请开启定位服务” 但我的定位服务并没有关闭。\n\n各位大神 ， 有办法不出境的情况下将境外 eSIM 添加到国行 iPhone 里？\n\n请纯技术讨论。谢谢。", "content_rendered": "<p>如题</p>\n<ul>\n<li>iPhone Duo 国行</li>\n<li>iOS 27.0.1</li>\n<li>中国联通 eSIM 已安装</li>\n</ul>\n<p>1 ，我用 Anygo 把 iPhone Duo 的定位改到了纽约\n2 ，用另一台 iPhone 上的 Tello 美国流量共享热点</p>\n<p>当在 iPhone Duo 国行上点击添加 eSIM ，会显示“ 请开启定位服务” 但我的定位服务并没有关闭。</p>\n<p>各位大神 ， 有办法不出境的情况下将境外 eSIM 添加到国行 iPhone 里？</p>\n<p>请纯技术讨论。谢谢。</p>\n", "last_modified": 1792815680, "replies": 27, "id": 1251454}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_large.png?m=1747623425", "name": "life", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_normal.png?m=1747623425", "title": "生活", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/life", "topics": 11971, "footer": "", "header": "生活中的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Life", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/6e27/13a6/557_mini.png?m=1747623425", "stars": 2529, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 557, "parent_node_name": ""}, "member": {"id": 684470, "username": "pydick", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/pydick", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a192e908e632c61b6fc32099d85fb53b?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a192e908e632c61b6fc32099d85fb53b?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a192e908e632c61b6fc32099d85fb53b?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1712707797, "last_modified": 1712707797, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "sme11ycat", "last_touched": 1792876187, "title": "大龄单身青年晚上都干啥", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1251553", "created": 1792847672, "deleted": 0, "content": "想问下，单身的大伙晚上都做啥。现在貌似对啥都失去兴趣了，打游戏，看直播，也没啥想去聊天的人", "content_rendered": "<p>想问下，单身的大伙晚上都做啥。现在貌似对啥都失去兴趣了，打游戏，看直播，也没啥想去聊天的人</p>\n", "last_modified": 1792847672, "replies": 24, "id": 1251553}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_large.png?m=1751736790", "name": "claude", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_normal.png?m=1751736790", "title": "Claude", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/claude", "topics": 1078, "footer": "", "header": "", "title_alternative": "Claude", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/df0a/ab05/1148_mini.png?m=1751736790", "stars": 777, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1148, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 119790, "username